    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni welili nindi atuŋi itala dejina daYehova, niitala dawanta windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakuchinda antu makombakaji makumi atanu nayedi akusendaŋa yiteli, niantu makombakaji makumi atanu nasatuakutemaŋ nyitondu kumapidi, niantu makombakaji asatu namakulakajatanu nadimu akuyitalaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakutemesha mazu kudi mwanta wakuTira Hurami akumwila nindi, Ilaku muwelili natata yami Davidi, muwamutemesheleli nyisidayakunamutuŋila itala dakushakama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, ami hinukutuŋila ijina daYehova Nzambi yami itala, kulonda kumujilikiladu, kulonda kumwochelaŋa insensiyevumba dadiwahi, kulonda kumuloŋeshela mankendi akutenteka kumesuindi hefuku hefuku, nikuhimulambu laŋa nyilambu yakushita nibudidi nimelela, nihajisabata, nihakwalukaŋa tukweji, nihayawija yaYehova Nzambi yetu yakushiika. Hilushimbi lwawaIsarela lwahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itala dinukutuŋadeneni; muloŋa Nzambi yetu hiNzambi muneni, wabadika amaneni ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyalanyi wukwi kala naŋovu jakunamutuŋila itala, yena wakwila iwuluniiwulu damawulu kutwesha kuwanamu nehi? Indi ami nimuntwinyimwaka nakanamutuŋili itala, chiŋa kwiji dakumwochelaŋa kwainsensi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu ntemesheli muntu wukweti wukalawenu wakwila yumayawuru, nasiliva, nawuneŋu, nayikuŋu, nawusombu niwanda wuchinanange, niwuzeeli, wukweti niwukalawenu wakubazabaza yuma, kulonda yena ekali hamu nawantu akweti wukalawenu inidi nawu munu muYuda namuYerusalema, anshilili tata yami Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntemesheli nawa ninyisidananyinjunŋa, nanyitondu yaaliŋumi yifumi kuLebanoni. Neluki namiambuŋeyi eluka kutema nyitondu yidi muLebanoni; tala, ambuŋami akekalaŋahamu nawambuŋeyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda akanloŋeshelaŋa nyitondu yayivulunankashi, muloŋa itala dinukukeŋa kutuŋa dikusweja kutoha dakuhayamahohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala, ambuŋeyi akwakutema nyitondu nukuyinka ngungungujatidiku jakuhumpula dehi makombakaji makumi ayedi, ningungungu jabali makombakaji makumi ayedi, ninswaha jeneni javinyu makombakaji makumi ayedi, ninswaha jeneni jamanji makombakaji makumi ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuTira Hurami hakusoneka mukanda, hakumutemeshela Solomoni, nindi, Ochu chanakeiliyi Yehova antu indi, dichi chanakudiishiliyi wanta wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hurami nindi, Kisu kisu, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarelawelili iwulu neseki, nenki mwanta Davidi mwana wukweti maana, welukamaana nakashinshi, kulonda atuŋi niitala daYehova niitala dawanta windi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakuchinda enyi ejima adiŋi mwituŋa daIsarela, mwomwayi chindililiyitata yindi Davidi, ayimweni anashiki mumakombakaji nkulakajina makombakaji makumi atanu, namakombakaji asatu namakulakaji atanunadimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makombakaji makumi atanu nayedi hakuyinka mudimu wakusendayiteli, makombakaji makumi atanu nasatu diwu adiŋi akwakutema nyitondu kumapidi, makombakaji asatu namakulakaji atanu nadimu diwu akwakutala akwawu kulonda kuyikalakeshaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
